B3 mutation check, 2026-11-08 15:45 UTC
Each mutant injects one bug into a copy of the repository; the testbenches that compile the mutated file run at seed 1,
fastest first, until one fails (U08-U09 with +QUICK: n = 2, 4, 8). RTL and package mutants run with the RTL assertions
compiled out (+define+SYNTHESIS), so only the testbenches can kill them; a mutant that survived would be run again
with the assertions on. Mutants of the reference model (sched_ref) show that the tests notice a wrong reference too.
Killed = a run fails (RESULT FAIL, $fatal, hang, or no RESULT line); the reason is the first error.

